1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:06,520
Congratulations on your choice of a Xenox PDP-alpha laser fax, copier and printer.

2
00:00:07,060 --> 00:00:13,080
All Xenox products incorporate the latest technology into attractive, versatile, and durable office equipment.

3
00:00:13,560 --> 00:00:19,540
This instruction manual will demonstrate clearly how to assemble, install, and use your new Xenox-alpha.

4
00:00:20,035 --> 00:00:26,580
As a first step, please ensure that you have a clear space that is large enough and has electrical and computer cable access.

5
00:00:27,200 --> 00:00:35,040
Next, in the package labeled ‘A’, you will find a training video, warranty documents, and after-sales service information.

6
00:00:35,880 --> 00:00:37,820
The video is designed for staff training.

7
00:00:38,160 --> 00:00:45,420
Please take the time to view it in order to get the best out of your new copier and to avoid costly damage due to incorrect use.

8
00:00:46,060 --> 00:00:48,480
Now, let's open package ‘B’, and begin assembly.
